      "seed": 2096595521,
      "version": 65,
      "versionNonce": 867218671,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784445654630,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A Proximity Service enables users to search for nearby points of interest (POIs) such as restaurants, gas stations\n, ATMs, stores, hospitals, and other businesses within a specified geographic radius.",
      "fontSize": 27.3333333333334,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A Proximity Service enables users to search for nearby points of interest (POIs) such as restaurants, gas stations\n, ATMs, stores, hospitals, and other businesses within a specified geographic radius.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uHdt2UgZEsZkPPpbX8_85",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 144.99999999999977,
      "y": 983,
      "width": 783.0636230468756,
      "height": 418.3333333333333,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 266552687,
      "version": 77,
      "versionNonce": 912592303,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784445701047,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Users should be able to search for nearby places using:\n    - Search radius\n    - Optional category filter\n\n    Response:\n\n    - Place ID\n    - Name\n    - Category\n    - Distance\n    - Coordinates\n    - Rating",
      "fontSize": 27.888888888888918,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Users should be able to search for nearby places using:\n    - Search radius\n    - Optional category filter\n\n    Response:\n\n    - Place ID\n    - Name\n    - Category\n    - Distance\n    - Coordinates\n    - Rating",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
