      "updated": 1784446027013,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Results should only include \n   POIs within the requested radius.\n2. Users can filter by category:\n3. Support incremental loading.\n4. Results should be sorted by:\n\n    1. Distance\n    2. Relevance\n    3. Popularity (optional)\n    4. Rating (optional)",
      "fontSize": 29.777777777777768,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Results should only include \n   POIs within the requested radius.\n2. Users can filter by category:\n3. Support incremental loading.\n4. Results should be sorted by:\n\n    1. Distance\n    2. Relevance\n    3. Popularity (optional)\n    4. Rating (optional)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "N_-Z1ZeMs21y2eFSOoxuC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 866.6666666666667,
      "y": 1604.6666666666667,
      "width": 686.01513671875,
