      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784446058528,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. Support incremental loading.\n\n6. Internal systems should be able to:\n\n    - Create POI\n    - Update POI\n    - Delete POI\n    - Update coordinates\n\n    Updates are relatively infrequent compared to \n    read traffic can be eventual consistent.",
      "fontSize": 28.121212121212128,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. Support incremental loading.\n\n6. Internal systems should be able to:\n\n    - Create POI\n    - Update POI\n    - Delete POI\n    - Update coordinates\n\n    Updates are relatively infrequent compared to \n    read traffic can be eventual consistent.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
